close_reason: "Done: pinned @unbrained/pm-cli at 2026.8.31, repaired the drifted ops-w3ke history stream hash, and reinstalled the pm-ops self-extension against the new binary. Updated the compatibility-floor test's REQUIRED_DEVELOPMENT_VERSION to match the new pin. pm health --strict-exit is green; changed files: .agents/pm/history/ops-w3ke.jsonl, package.json, package-lock.json, test/compatibility-floor.test.ts; no .toon payloads modified."
